          "decoupledEngineLogic": "Iterate dynamically over Object.keys(canvases) or config.nodes.map(n => n.id). Snapshot creation, diffing, draft publishing, and edge KV pre-baking must handle arbitrary N nodes (N >= 1) with zero hardcoded arrays.",
          "rationale": "Hardcoded loops prevent multi-tenant scaling and silently discard or fail data operations on non-5-pillar tenant sequences."
