          "decoupledEngineLogic": "Dynamic route parser matching against config.nodes.find(n => n.id === candidateId || String(n.index) === candidateId). Unknown slugs resolve to configurable 404, not hardcoded 5-pillar checks.",
          "rationale": "Static dictionary gatekeeper rejects any tenant route slug not named access, equity, quality, resiliency, or governance."
