          "legacyLogicPattern": "travelY = 4 * segmentH, static 5-point points array, and chapterFoldH = travel / 4 with p1/p5 queries",
          "decoupledEngineLogic": "Parametric N-node mathematical curve: travelY = Math.max(0, nodes.length - 1) * segmentH. Node coordinates computed via nodes.map((node, i) => ({ x: i % 2 === 0 ? leftX : rightX, y: y0 + i * segmentH, flank: i % 2 === 0 ? 'left' : 'right' })). Scroll progress divides by (nodes.length - 1).",
          "rationale": "Hardcoded coordinate arrays break track rendering and camera scroll calculation when node count != 5."
        },
